# Normalize line endings.
#
# This repo is checked out on a Windows drive under WSL, which rewrites files
# with CRLF and makes `git status` report thousands of files as modified when
# nothing has actually changed. With `text=auto` git stores LF in the
# repository, and `eol=lf` checks LF back out, so the working tree and the
# index agree regardless of platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-native scripts genuinely need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.zip  binary
*.node binary
